integration_imminent.description:
Home Assistant {release} removes an API that `{domain}` still uses, and that release is due {due}.

{where}

If no fix arrives before then, you can stay on your current Home Assistant version or replace the integration. This notification clears itself once `{domain}` no longer uses the removed API.

integration_broken.description:
This system runs Home Assistant {release} or later, and `{domain}` still uses an API that release removed, so it is most likely failing right now.

{where}

This notification clears itself once `{domain}` no longer uses the removed API. The exact file and line are on `sensor.breakage_radar_affected`.
